#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9701 expect=noViolation domain=FA
# Rule:Description: PMDA-SD9701 — the Required key FAOBJ is not populated.
#note "FAOBJ populated -> noViolation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of FAOBJ."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset FA
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col FASEQ type=Char
col FATESTCD type=Char
col FATEST type=Char
col FAOBJ type=Char
---
S1      | FA     | S1-001  | 1     | SEV      | Severity | RASH
---
